Data
----

No third-party data is bundled with the application yet. (The source tree
has test data that is not distributed: tests/data/geodtest-sample.dat, a
sample of C. F. F. Karney's "Test set for geodesics", CC0 1.0,
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.32156.) The base pack (Phase 3) will add
WVS, Blue Marble and others; each dataset will be listed here with its
source, licence and required attribution.

